{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper Fin is a <strong>Movement Based Fighting Game</strong>\u00a0built around <strong>Speed</strong>! Using your drift, dash, and slow time abilities, you'll out-maneuver enemies to Blast yourself into their weak points.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.poster.avif?t=1770242455\" width=614 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.webm?t=1770242455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721440/extras/31e1998c7563a75814e3c19b89b94ccc.mp4?t=1770242455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unique, fast paced movement gameplay that will demand instant, gut-feeling moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a variety of enemies in intense hoard battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bast through an everchanging arena  that takes full advantage of the 3D space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system is built around speed! Players are encouraged to make risky split-second decisions to save seconds off their time! Speed-running influences every aspect of the game from the story, campaign,  to even the creature collection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of different creatures and skins as you fill out your collection and show off on the high score boards! Collectable spawn rates are influenced by your level times, so you'll be rewarded for each part of the game you master. If you're lucky you may even encounter shinnies!</p>